; GaiaLabs Retranslation, chapter 20. Dialogue only.

?INCLUDE 'sp5A_monologue'
sp5A_monologue.dialogstring_06856E! `[CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@CastleV051Will]Will: So this is Mu…[N]I don't know what I[N]expected, but it wasn't[N]this.[FIN][CLD][BOR:6][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme2]Lilly: Will...[N]Are you talking to me,[N]or yourself?[FIN][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@CastleV051Will]Will: Of course I was![N]Why? Do I seem like[N]the sort of person who[N]talks to himself?[END]`

?INCLUDE 'mu61_hint'
mu61_hint.dialogstring_0697C9! `[CLD][DEF][DLG:3,15][SIZ:D,2]Lilly speaks from inside[N]Will's pocket.[FIN][CLD][BOR:6][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme2]Lilly: Hey, Will. Look at[N]these stone statues.[WAI][N]Don't they seem to be[N]staring at something?[N]Their lines of sight cross[N]at that treasure chest.[WAI][N]Maybe the other statues[N]are watching something[N]too. Or maybe I'm[N]overthinking it.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'mu62_hope_statue'
mu62_hope_statue.dialogstring_0698D2! `[DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][SFX:0][DLY:9]Will finds a prayer statue![N][PAU:3C][CLD][BOR:6][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme2][SFX:0][DLY:2]Lilly: I bet it goes on[N]the altar in the room[N]with the same name.[PAU:5A][END]`
mu62_hope_statue.dialogstring_069925! `[DLG:3,13][SIZ:D,3]Will finds the Statue[N]of Hope! But your[N]inventory is full![END]`
mu62_hope_statue.dialogstring_069975! `[DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][SFX:0][DLY:9]Will finds a prayer statue![N][PAU:3C][CLD][BOR:6][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme2][SFX:0][DLY:2]Lilly: There's another[N]room with the same name.[N]I bet it goes on the[N]altar there.[PAU:5A][END]`

?INCLUDE 'item_use_system'
item_use_system.dialogstring_0392DE! `[DLG:3,17][SIZ:D,1]Offered the prayer statue![FIN]`
item_use_system.dialogstring_0392FB! `But nothing happens![END]`
item_use_system.dialogstring_03930B! `[DLG:3,13][SIZ:D,3]An eerie voice could be[N]heard descending from[N]somewhere...[END]`

?INCLUDE 'mu63_spirits'
mu63_spirits.dialogstring_069BAA! `[CLD][BOR:4][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme17]O spirit of the sun[AD] O[N]Rama[AD][WAI][N]Bestow your power upon the[N]great ocean[AD][END]`

?INCLUDE 'sp5A_monologue'
sp5A_monologue.dialogstring_0685D3! `[CLD][BOR:6][DLG:3,15][SIZ:D,2][PRT:@RetranslationTheme2]Lilly: Ah! The water[N]level went down![FIN][CLD][BOR:6][DLG:3,15][SIZ:D,2][PRT:@RetranslationTheme2]There must be a way down[N]now.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'sE6_gaia'
sE6_gaia.dialogstring_08E2F8! `[PRT:@dialogstring_08DE96]When thy journey began,[N]Mu rose again toward the[N]sea's surface.[FIN]Yet much of the continent[N]remains drowned.[FIN]Release the waters, and[N]the road to Mu's king,[N]Rama, shall be revealed.[FIN]`
sE6_gaia.dialogstring_08E3A7! `[BOR:4][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@CastleV051Gaia]Watch for narrow cracks[N]and low passages.[N]Psycho Slider can carry[N]thee through them.[FIN][RET]`
sE6_gaia.dialogstring_08EC66! `[BOR:4][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@CastleV051Gaia]While running, attack to[N]slide. Psycho Slider can[N]pass beneath barriers and[N]through narrow openings.`

?INCLUDE 'mu66_altar_dialog'
mu66_altar_dialog.dialogstring_069CB7! `[CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@CastleV051Thought](It looks like this was[N]the cemetery for Mu's[N]people[AD])[END]`

?INCLUDE 'mu66_rama_spirits'
mu66_rama_spirits.dialogstring_069F45! `[CLD][BOR:4][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme17]Rama: I was once king of[N]Mu.[WAI][N]My body was lost long ago,[N]yet my spirit remains.[WAI][N]Look carefully. The souls[N]of my people still wander[N]here.[END]`
mu66_rama_spirits.dialogstring_069FBE! `[CLD][BOR:4][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme17]Rama: Listen to the souls[N]that have awakened.[WAI][N]Mu was divided when the[N]light appeared.[WAI][N]Even now, their memories[N]do not speak with one[N]voice.[END]`
mu66_rama_spirits.dialogstring_06A0A6! `[CLD][BOR:4][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme17]A beam of light once shone[N]down from the sky.[FIN][CLD][BOR:4][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme17]We believed it was the[N]light of the spirits and[N]knelt before it.[FIN][CLD][BOR:4][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme17]Some priests said it would[N]free us from sickness,[N]aging, and the frailty of[N]the flesh.[FIN][CLD][BOR:4][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme17]Some welcomed the promise.[N]They believed life could[N]at last be freed from[N]suffering and change. [FIN][CLD][BOR:4][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme17]Others feared that a life[N]given its final form was[N]no longer truly alive.[FIN][CLD][BOR:4][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme17]They turned instead toward[N]the Darkness.[END]`
mu66_rama_spirits.dialogstring_06A0EC! `[CLD][BOR:4][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme17]A year after the heavenly[N]light appeared, our bodies[N]began to change.[FIN][CLD][BOR:4][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme17]Those who surrendered to[N]the light changed only[N]once.[FIN][CLD][BOR:4][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme17]Their forms became[N]beautiful, ageless,[N]untouched by sickness or[N]decay.[FIN][CLD][BOR:4][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme17]But those who rejected its[N]final form and embraced[N]the Darkness[FIN][CLD][BOR:4][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme17]were cursed by the[N]comet to change again and[N]again.[FIN][CLD][BOR:4][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme17]Some grew thin as reeds.[N]Some became hard as stone.[FIN][CLD][BOR:4][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme17]Others lost their solid[N]shape and flowed like[N]water.[FIN][CLD][BOR:4][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme17]The freedom to change had[N]become a terrible thing.[END]`
mu66_rama_spirits.dialogstring_06A154! `[CLD][BOR:4][DLG:3,13][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme17]Our families and friends[N]changed until some no[N]longer knew themselves.[FIN][CLD][BOR:4][DLG:3,13][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme17]When they attacked, we[N]raised our weapons against[N]people we still loved.[FIN][CLD][BOR:4][DLG:3,13][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme17]We fought through tears.[END]`
mu66_rama_spirits.dialogstring_06A1C9! `[CLD][BOR:4][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme17]Many could no longer bear[N]what Mu had become.[WAI][N]They wanted to flee,[N]but Mu was an island[N]surrounded by the[N]open sea.[WAI][N]We had neither ships nor[N]wood enough to build them.[WAI][N]So our people chose an[N]impossible road instead:[N]through the earth beneath[N]the ocean.[END]`
mu66_rama_spirits.dialogstring_06A19E! `[CLD][BOR:4][DLG:3,13][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme17]Some lost the will to go[N]on.[FIN][CLD][BOR:4][DLG:3,13][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme17]Others said that while we[N]still had choices left, we[N]had to keep living.[END]`
mu66_rama_spirits.dialogstring_06A26D! `[CLD][BOR:4][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme17]So the people began[N]digging an undersea[N]tunnel.[WAI][N]They knew the work might[N]outlive them by centuries[AD][WAI][N]perhaps even by millennia.[WAI][N]Still they dug, trusting a[N]future they themselves[N]would never see.[END]`
mu66_rama_spirits.dialogstring_069FE3! `[CLD][BOR:4][DLG:3,13][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme17]Rama: The tunnel my[N]people began lies beyond[N]here.[FIN][CLD][BOR:4][DLG:3,13][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme17]Take this Mystic Statue.[N]Carry their hope with you.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'mu67_erik'
mu67_erik.dialogstring_06A36B! `[BOR:3][DLG:3,15][SIZ:D,2][PRT:@RetranslationTheme3]Erik: Waaaaaaah…[N]Somebody saaave me…!![END]`

?INCLUDE 'mu67_vampires'
mu67_vampires.dialogstring_0AFB45! `[CLD][BOR:B][DLG:3,13][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme21]Vampire man: Well done![N]You found the Mystic[N]Statue for us.[FIN][CLD][BOR:B][DLG:3,13][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme21]I thought letting you[N]escape the palace might[N]pay off.[FIN][CLD][BOR:B][DLG:3,13][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme22]Vampire woman: Listen to[N]you![FIN][CLD][BOR:B][DLG:3,13][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme22]You drool whenever fresh[N]prey wanders in.[FIN][CLD][BOR:B][DLG:3,13][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme22]Especially children.[FIN][CLD][BOR:B][DLG:3,13][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme21]Vampire man: You're one to[N]talk![FIN][CLD][BOR:B][DLG:3,13][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme21]…Wait. This is no time for[N]a lover's quarrel.[FIN][CLD][BOR:B][DLG:3,13][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme21]First we'll take that[N]Mystic Statue.[FIN][CLD][BOR:B][DLG:3,13][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme21]You there-prepare[N]yourself![END]`
mu67_vampires.dialogstring_0AFCA0! `[CLD][BOR:B][DLG:3,13][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme22]Vampire woman: Hmph. So[N]much for him.[FIN][CLD][BOR:B][DLG:3,13][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme22]Alright, you're next[AD]!![N]Get ready[AD]!![PAU:78][END]`
mu67_vampires.dialogstring_0AFCE4! `[CLD][BOR:B][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme21]Vampire man: You bastard[AD]![N]How could you do that to[N]my wife[AD]!! I'll never[N]forgive you[AD]!!!![PAU:78][END]`

?INCLUDE 'mu67_erik'
mu67_erik.dialogstring_06A38D! `[CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,13][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme3]Forget everything else-[N]stop the booomb[AD]! Hurry,[N]hurry[AD]!![END]`

?INCLUDE 'mu67_bomb'
mu67_bomb.dialogstring_06A4E9! `[BOR:3][DLG:3,13][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@CastleV051Thought](A red wire and a blue[N]wire are hanging out of[N]the bomb[AD][FIN]Which one should I cut?)[N][PAL:0] Cut red[N] Cut blue[PAL:4]`
mu67_bomb.dialogstring_06A54E! `[CLR]The red wire is cut![END]`
mu67_bomb.dialogstring_06A566! `[CLR]The blue wire is cut![END]`
mu67_bomb.dialogstring_06A719! `[CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@CastleV051Thought](...........)[FIN](It's a dud.[N]I'm saved...)[PAL:0][END]`
mu67_bomb.dialogstring_06A57F! `[PAU:28][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@CastleV051Will]Will: It stopped[AD][FIN][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme3]Erik: I'm saaaved[AD]![FIN][CLD][DEF]Lilly speaks from inside[N]Will's pocket.[FIN][CLD][BOR:6][DLG:3,11][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme2]Lilly: Sorry, Will.[N]I couldn't do anything.[WAI][N]My legs froze. I couldn't[N]even make my voice work.[WAI][N]I thought I was the[N]dependable one, but when[N]it mattered, I was[N]terrified.[WAI][N][AD]I'll stay in your[N]pocket a little longer,[N]if that's okay.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'mu67_erik'
mu67_erik.dialogstring_06A3B8! `[BOR:3][DLG:3,15][SIZ:D,2][PRT:@RetranslationTheme3]Erik: I won't tell anyone[N]that you transformed.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'mu67_neil_lily'
mu67_neil_lily.dialogstring_06A7C7! `[CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme16]Neil: Will! Are you[N]safe[AD]?![FIN][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme4]Lance: Will! Have you seen[N]Lilly? Is she okay?![FIN][CLD][BOR:6][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme2]Lilly: I'm here[AD][END]`
mu67_neil_lily.dialogstring_06AA4C! `[CLD][BOR:6][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme2]Lilly: Sorry we worried[N]you. Will and I looked[N]out for each other.[END]`
mu67_neil_lily.dialogstring_06AA89! `[CLD][BOR:D][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme6]Neil: Oh? Will's[N]becoming quite the[N]gentleman, isn't he?[END]`

?INCLUDE 'mu67_kara'
mu67_kara.dialogstring_06A894! `[CLD][BOR:7][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1]Kara: Never mind that.[N]How do we get off Mu?[FIN][CLD][BOR:6][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme2]Lilly: We may already have[N]the answer.[WAI][N]That spirit, Rama, told[N]us about an undersea[N]tunnel.[FIN][CLD][DEF]Will tells everyone the[N]story of Mu and the people[N]who dug beneath the sea.[FIN][CLD][BOR:7][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1]Kara: They spent[N]their whole lives building[N]a road for people they[N]would never meet[AD][FIN][CLD][BOR:D][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme6]Neil: And that road may be[N]our way out.[FIN][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme4]Lance: Then what are we[N]waitin' for? Let's go![END]`
